  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. The code type-checks and the 42 digest-related tests pass.\n\n1. **Recipients:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now returns only people with at least one setting where they chose digest delivery (`digestOnly = true`). Before, it returned anyone with any notification setting in the workspace.\n2. **Which updates are kept:** `buildDigest` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` now puts the updates newest first before applying the cap. The digest keeps the most recent updates, and the headline is the latest one.\n3. **Archived workspaces:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` now returns false for an archived workspace, so it sends no digest. `buildDigest` also returns nothing for an archived workspace as a backup check. Live workspaces work as before.",
